# Optional API base URL, inlined at build time. Leave unset for `npm run dev`
# (the app uses http://localhost:3000). An https address, or http for localhost
# or 127.0.0.1, overrides that default and the production-host fallback.
# A username, a password, or any other value is ignored. See README.md for
# precedence. Do not point this
# at production for local or preview builds.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
